      "comment": "BOX FLY BANDIT (1) has a strong winning strike-rate here with two wins and a placing from four tries. Placed last time (20.17) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 8 lengths. Expected to go close. TAW MYSTIQUE (4) ran below best last time finishing fourth (29.98) over 515m at Sandown in a Special conditions H. Has a good record here at this journey. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. LUMEAH THUNDER (2) has been hard to follow lately, running fifth (29.99) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Key player on best and worth another try. ZIPPING STITCH (6) jumps at a shorter trip and still warrants respect.",
